"use strict";(self.webpackChunkdocs=self.webpackChunkdocs||[]).push([[31725],{39368:e=>{e.exports=JSON.parse('{"functions":[],"properties":[],"types":[],"name":"CollisionGroups","desc":"Authoritative registrar for every physics CollisionGroup in the game and the\\nsingle place their collidability matrix is defined. Requiring this module\\n(cached, so it runs exactly once) registers the groups and applies the\\nrelationships below; consumers then assign `part.CollisionGroup` using the\\nexported name constants.\\n\\nGroups (besides the built-in `Default`):\\n- `Character` \u2014 every BasePart of a player character (see CharacterCollisionService)\\n  or of a faction-tagged model (`\\"EnemyNPC\\"` / `\\"FriendlyNPC\\"`, see NpcCollisionService).\\n- `WeaponProjectile` \u2014 thrown charges / physics projectiles (see ServerProjectile).\\n- `DroppedMaterial` / `DroppableSurface` \u2014 the proximity/drop item system.\\n\\nRelationships (only non-default entries; new groups collide with everything by\\ndefault, so we only turn the wrong pairs OFF):\\n\\n| A                | B                | Collidable | Why |\\n|------------------|------------------|------------|-----|\\n| DroppedMaterial  | Default          |     \u2717 \\t   | drops pass through characters/walls/untagged world  \\t|\\n| DroppedMaterial  | DroppableSurface |     \u2713 \\t   | \u2026and only land on tagged surfaces \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t\\t|\\n| DroppedMaterial  | Character        |     \u2717      | preserve pass-through now that characters left Default \\t|\\n| WeaponProjectile | Character        |     \u2717      | charges pass through ALL players (AOE handles damage) \\t|\\n| WeaponProjectile | WeaponProjectile |     \u2717      | charges don\'t knock each other around \\t\\t\\t\\t\\t|\\n| WeaponProjectile | DroppedMaterial  |     \u2717      | loose junk doesn\'t stop a charge mid-flight \\t\\t\\t|\\n\\nEverything else stays default-true: `WeaponProjectile` collides with `Default`\\n+ `DroppableSurface` (so it bounces/sticks on arbitrary world geometry), and\\n`Character` collides with `Default`/`DroppableSurface`/`Character` (players\\ncollide with world, platforms, and each other exactly as before).","realm":["Server"],"source":{"line":35,"path":"src/ServerStorage/SharedModules/CollisionGroups.luau"}}')}}]);